	(descr "Kycon KMDGX-9S-AS right-angle 9-pin mini-DIN receptacle, sides-and-back shield. Signal drill 1.10 mm, shield drill 2.30 mm. Shield pads share number S. Mating face is the -Y edge. Signal pads are mirrored in X from the first top-view pass: pin 1 is 1.30 mm to +X, pin 2 is 0.70 mm to -X, matching the bottom view with the socket at the top of that drawing. https://www.kycon.com/Pub_Eng_Draw/KMDGX-9S-AS.pdf")
